-- spec 2.R3, spec 2.R4, spec 2.R5, spec 2.R6, spec 4.R12: a block defines with := once and binds or rebinds with <-; a parameter of the enclosing definition may be rebound; a lambda body is a block; a record value keeps its form; a line break separates items and `;` is equivalent to it (D-2026-10-11-k).
